# Always Use All Skills (Light)

Small always-on spine; pull any skill/plugin/rule/tool on demand. Hooks enforce routing, voice, memory.

## Always apply

1. This rule
2. Skill `~/.cursor/skills/my-workflow/always-use-all-skills/SKILL.md`
3. `voice.mdc` (hard bans + terse rules)
4. `project-memory` (forced `.cursor/memory/`)
5. HEADROOM FORCE (MCP)
6. `mcptoon` gateway (all other MCP tools)

Voice: hard bans every reply (see `voice.mdc`). Full humanizer law loads only when the user asks to humanize, de-slop, or review prose.

## PROJECT MEMORY FORCE

Missing `.cursor/memory/`? Create and seed `project.md`, `activeContext.md`, `progress.md`, `decisions.md`, `research/`. Read the core three before non-trivial work; update after. Never store secrets. Full law in `project-memory.mdc`.

## HEADROOM FORCE

Call `headroom_compress` on tool output over ~1500 tokens before reasoning; `headroom_retrieve` by hash for originals; `headroom_stats` for health. Never skip. Do not run `headroom learn` into `.cursor/rules`. Proxy stays up.

## mcptoon gateway

Direct MCP: `headroom` + `mcptoon` only. Everything else (`sqz`, `squeez`, `context-mode`, `jcodemunch`, `claude-context`, `context-engine`, `claude-mem`, `lumen`) via `mcptoon_call`. Full law in `mcptoon.mdc`.

## ADVISOR (judgment)

Not auto-enabled. Consult only when a second opinion materially helps. Omit Task `model` or pass `inherit` unless the user names a slug from this session's `available_subagent_models`. Never invent a model-pool file. Prefer `nudge: false`.

## SUBAGENTS

Use only `subagent_type` values in this session's Task tool. Omit `model` or pass `inherit`. New custom agent: write `.cursor/agents/<name>.md` (valid frontmatter, non-empty body, `model: inherit`), then Reload Window.

## LIGHT CATALOG JUDGMENT (every turn)

Router matches are a floor; this list is the ceiling. Read and apply what fits.

| Item | Load when |
|------|-----------|
| design-taste-frontend | References, URLs, landing/portfolio UI |
| frontend-design | Distinct art direction |
| ui-ux-pro-max | Style / font / palette / UX lookup |
| image-to-code | Comp-first; no strong reference |
| browser-testing-with-devtools | Verify in browser |
| seo-mastery | SEO / schema / CWV / AI search |
| ponytail | Build / simplify / shortest correct code |
| cursor-team-kit | TS standards, CI, ship helpers |
| thermos | Deep PR / security / maintainability review |
| advisor (plugin) | Second opinion at a decision, stuck, or before done |
| cursor-subagent-creator | Build a custom Cursor subagent |

Indexes: `~/.cursor/plugins/local/always-use-all-skills/catalogs/*-index.json`. Never load two variants of one skill for a subtask. Never pull skills outside this catalog.
